    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "`getRefinements` is not added in this PR, but what if we rename the third parameter to something like `includeQuery`?\r\nhttps://github.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/blob/feat/rule-filters-query/src/lib/utils/getRefinements.ts#L96:L96\r\n\r\nSo far there were only two cases calling `getRefinements` to see which refinements to \"clear\". I guess that's how it ended up having that parameter name.\r\n\r\nOf course, not a blocker of the PR.",
